+### Explicit workspace-free runs
+
+`Runtime.startAgentRun` accepts `workspace: "none"` with explicit `agent.toolNames: []`. It preserves the same Character, text resources, history, loop, control, budget and Session ledger while rejecting workspace access and tools. Rooted runs keep their required-root behavior. See [bounded Agent scopes](../../../../docs/slices/bounded-inference.md).
