+
+### Trusted per-Run grants
+
+The Runtime may bind trusted App tool/root grants privately to one Session/Run/authorized-root. They use this same effect ledger and evaluator, never caller-provided origin as authority. Cached effects and dispatch require the original live capability; expiry and restart do not recreate grants. Denies, unknown kinds, escalation, hooks and Host restrictions remain stronger. The bounded public API supports whole authorized roots only (`paths: ["."]`), not lexical child-directory isolation.
